<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tomorrow, huh...</font>

32
00:01:53,380 --> 00:01:59,430
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Furious, Intense Chase</font>

33
00:01:53,380 --> 00:01:59,430
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">and Aggressive Dash</font>

34
00:01:53,380 --> 00:01:59,430
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Main Matches Begin</font>

35
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up? It's been a while.</font>

36
00:02:14,940 --> 00:02:17,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh heh...
I was kind of in the hospital.</font>

37
00:02:17,820 --> 00:02:18,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The hospital?</font>

38
00:02:18,860 --> 00:02:21,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm totally fine, now.</font>

39
00:02:21,370 --> 00:02:23,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing to it!</font>

40
00:02:24,370 --> 00:02:25,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

41
00:02:27,830 --> 00:02:29,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Ayame!
— Yes!</font>

42
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:32,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you go.</font>

43
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:41,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pops?</font>

44
00:02:42,430 --> 00:02:43,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just eat it.</font>

45
00:02:44,350 --> 00:02:46,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The final round is tomorrow, right?</font>

46
00:02:52,020 --> 00:02:52,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, then.</font>

47
00:02:53,900 --> 00:02:55,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks!</font>

48
00:03:01,950 --> 00:03:05,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got a daughter at home,
so it's not so bad, right?</font>

49
00:03:05,790 --> 00:03:08,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Most of my money vanishes
with the food expenses.</font>

50
00:03:08,830 --> 00:03:12,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moron. Your home is special, right?</font>

51
00:03:12,460 --> 00:03:13,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

52
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Girls are a drag.</font>

53
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:21,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. There are times when I really
don't get how to act with her.</font>

54
00:03:21,550 --> 00:03:24,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fathers have it rough...</font>

55
00:03:24,850 --> 00:03:27,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah, am I the only bad guy?</font>

56
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:30,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, mister.</font>

57
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:33,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me have everything
on these two pages, too!</font>

58
00:03:34,060 --> 00:03:35,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Welcome!</font>

59
00:03:37,690 --> 00:03:40,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Strong reinforcements!</font>

60
00:03:40,570 --> 00:03:42,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on. You order something, too!</font>

61
00:03:46,450 --> 00:03:48,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... Dad.</font>

62
00:03:48,370 --> 00:03:49,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

63
00:03:49,750 --> 00:03:52,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Let's go home, already!</font>

64
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:53,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me?</font>

65
00:03:53,750 --> 00:03:58,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up. You're supposed to
live it up at a festival!</font>

66
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:00,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Festival, my ass...</font>

67
00:04:01,920 --> 00:04:03,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a drag.</font>

68
00:04:03,590 --> 00:04:06,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot... Since olden times...</font>

69
00:04:11,730 --> 00:04:15,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the final round's
been like a festival!</font>

70
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:18,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm in that final round tomorrow.</font>

71
00:04:18,440 --> 00:04:21,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, don't make me come to get you.</font>

72
00:04:23,070 --> 00:04:25,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're... in it?</font>

73
00:04:29,740 --> 00:04:31,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please, Dad...</font>

74
00:05:00,900 --> 00:05:02,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tomorrow, eh...</font>

75
00:05:03,950 --> 00:05:04,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

76
00:05:16,870 --> 00:05:20,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tomorrow... is a full moon...</font>

77
00:06:14,430 --> 00:06:16,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think you didn't even
get a scratch...</font>

78
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:19,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perfect, eh, Neji?</font>

79
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:23,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's enough warm-up exercise...</font>

80
00:06:25,690 --> 00:06:26,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall we get going?</font>

81
00:06:43,090 --> 00:06:46,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was nervous and couldn't sleep.</font>

82
00:06:49,470 --> 00:06:53,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First... it's him...
in the first match.</font>

83
00:06:55,970 --> 00:06:59,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Quite honestly... even my Sharingan
can't see through his Tenketsu!</font>

84
00:07:00,650 --> 00:07:05,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The strongest man in the
Leaf is on my team.</font>

85
00:07:05,980 --> 00:07:09,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is that... Hyuga Neji!</font>

86
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:11,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji... Neji... Neji...</font>

87
00:07:38,140 --> 00:07:39,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At last...</font>

88
00:07:49,070 --> 00:07:51,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The first match is Hyuga Neji, right?!</font>

89
00:07:52,280 --> 00:07:55,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. He's the number one rookie
from last year, right?!</font>

90
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't miss the first match!</font>

91
00:07:59,660 --> 00:08:02,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hyuga... Neji...</font>

92
00:08:06,210 --> 00:08:10,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now I can summon a frog...
It'll be okay.</font>

93
00:08:15,090 --> 00:08:19,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They all... look nasty.</font>

94
00:08:34,780 --> 00:08:35,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata?</font>

95
00:08:36,990 --> 00:08:38,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Naruto-kun.</font>

96
00:08:39,910 --> 00:08:41,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What are you doing here?</font>

97
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today is the final round, isn't it?</font>

98
00:08:46,670 --> 00:08:49,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... Just something...</font>

99
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:53,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I came to check out this training field.</font>

100
00:08:53,380 --> 00:08:56,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the place where
I became Genin, so...</font>

101
00:08:59,810 --> 00:09:02,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really? W-Why?</font>

102
00:09:02,930 --> 00:09:07,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Nothing... That doesn't matter!</font>

103
00:09:07,900 --> 00:09:10,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You're right. I'm sorry.</font>

104
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:14,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say, Hinata...</font>

105
00:09:15,650 --> 00:09:18,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji's a relative of yours, right?</font>

106
00:09:19,330 --> 00:09:20,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yes.</font>

107
00:09:22,290 --> 00:09:24,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he really strong...?</font>

108
00:09:27,790 --> 00:09:28,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

109
00:09:30,670 --> 00:09:31,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

110
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:35,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But you might be able to win, Naruto-kun.</font>

111
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:39,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. I'm strong, after all!</font>

112
00:09:50,310 --> 00:09:52,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I bet you can win, Naruto-kun.</font>

113
00:09:52,980 --> 00:09:53,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

114
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:55,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know...</font>

115
00:09:55,820 --> 00:09:59,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... when you cheered for me,</font>

116
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:02,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I felt like I was able to become
stronger than before.</font>

117
00:10:02,740 --> 00:10:05,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata! Hang tough!</font>

118
00:10:05,700 --> 00:10:07,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When the preliminaries ended,</font>

119
00:10:07,580 --> 00:10:10,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I became able to like
myself just a little.</font>

120
00:10:13,090 --> 00:10:14,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll...</font>

121
00:10:16,340 --> 00:10:17,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">stand...</font>

122
00:10:20,390 --> 00:10:22,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by my own...</font>

123
00:10:23,640 --> 00:10:24,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">words.</font>

124
00:10:26,230 --> 00:10:30,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is my Ninja Way.</font>

125
00:10:31,020 --> 00:10:35,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From someone else's standpoint,
it might not look like anything's changed...</font>

126
00:10:35,990 --> 00:10:39,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I feel like I was able to change.</font>

127
00:10:40,910 --> 00:10:45,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been thinking that it was...
thanks to you, Naruto-kun.</font>

128
00:10:48,210 --> 00:10:49,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say, Hinata...</font>

129
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you really think so?</font>

130
00:10:54,210 --> 00:10:54,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

131
00:10:58,010 --> 00:11:02,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I may look strong to you,</font>

132
00:11:03,010 --> 00:11:05,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but all I do is mess up...</font>

133
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:09,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I act tough because
I'm frustrated.</font>

134
00:11:09,980 --> 00:11:11,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not like that!</font>

135
00:11:12,690 --> 00:11:15,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even when you messed up,</font>

136
00:11:16,980 --> 00:11:21,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in my view... you were always
a proud failure.</font>

137
00:11:22,870 --> 00:11:27,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-When I look at you,
it impacts my heart.</font>

138
00:11:28,700 --> 00:11:30,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not perfect, so...</font>

139
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:32,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So...</font>

140
00:11:33,920 --> 00:11:35,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because you mess up...</font>

141
00:11:36,050 --> 00:11:39,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that you have the strength
to rise up from that.</font>

142
00:11:40,090 --> 00:11:45,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think such strength is
true strength.</font>

143
00:11:47,310 --> 00:11:51,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... I think you're an
incredibly strong person.</font>

144
00:12:00,820 --> 00:12:02,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks, Hinata!</font>

145
00:12:05,280 --> 00:12:08,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though I was always
the bottom one...</font>

146
00:12:08,740 --> 00:12:11,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was tense in the shoulders, somehow!</font>

147
00:12:11,830 --> 00:12:14,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was depressed,
which was totally not my character.</font>

148
00:12:14,250 --> 00:12:16,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I feel better now!</font>

149
00:12:18,090 --> 00:12:19,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

150
00:12:19,670 --> 00:12:22,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! I'm off to the match!</font>

151
00:12:26,890 --> 00:12:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata...</font>

152
00:12:28,220 --> 00:12:29,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

153
00:12:29,890 --> 00:12:33,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I kind of... thought you were...</font>

154
00:12:33,690 --> 00:12:35,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What...?</font>

155
00:12:35,810 --> 00:12:39,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...gloomy, hesitant and weird.</font>

156
00:12:39,820 --> 00:12:41,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

157
00:12:42,070 --> 00:12:44,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I quite like... people...</font>

158
00:12:46,820 --> 00:12:49,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">like you!</font>

159
00:12:52,370 --> 00:12:53,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...like you!</font>

160
00:13:02,130 --> 00:13:06,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, yeah! Be sure to come watch me
kick that Neji's butt!</font>

161
00:13:10,850 --> 00:13:13,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh-oh. Time to run!</font>

162
00:13:14,180 --> 00:13:15,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'm late, late!</font>

163
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:17,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See you later, Hinata!</font>

164
00:13:22,650 --> 00:13:25,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry I'm late, Hinata.</font>

165
00:13:25,950 --> 00:13:28,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, Shino's match isn't until
quite a bit later, so...</font>

166
00:13:29,330 --> 00:13:31,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm? Hey? Hinata?</font>

167
00:13:42,380 --> 00:13:45,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm? W-What?</font>

168
00:13:54,810 --> 00:13:56,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's starting!</font>

169
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:58,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Move, move!</font>

170
00:13:58,480 --> 00:14:00,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C'mon, move!</font>

171
00:14:00,770 --> 00:14:03,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! There's quite a distance!</font>

172
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:04,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't make it!</font>

173
00:14:04,990 --> 00:14:06,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto nii-chan!</font>

174
00:14:09,990 --> 00:14:11,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru?!</font>

175
00:14:12,030 --> 00:14:15,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've come to aid in nii-chan's crisis, here!</font>

176
00:14:15,410 --> 00:14:18,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru...
What're you doing here?!</font>

177
00:14:18,830 --> 00:14:19,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll tell you later!</font>

178
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:20,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This way, here!</font>

179
00:14:21,500 --> 00:14:25,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's an ace shortcut where
you can get straight to the arena, here!</font>

180
00:14:26,130 --> 00:14:27,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

181
00:14:27,170 --> 00:14:30,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!
Well done, Konohamaru!</font>

182
00:14:30,510 --> 00:14:34,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who control the
secret path control time.</font>

183
00:14:34,430 --> 00:14:38,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I see!
You're awesome, Konohamaru!</font>

184
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:41,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I recall, there's a hole
in the wall around here...</font>

185
00:14:41,980 --> 00:14:42,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

186
00:14:43,070 --> 00:14:43,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here it is!</font>

187
00:14:45,820 --> 00:14:46,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

188
00:14:47,780 --> 00:14:49,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter, Konohamaru?</font>

189
00:14:50,950 --> 00:14:53,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The secret path has been repaired, here!</font>

190
00:14:53,910 --> 00:14:55,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

191
00:14:55,410 --> 00:14:57,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! There's no time!</font>

192
00:14:58,000 --> 00:14:58,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-chan!</font>

193
00:14:59,460 --> 00:15:00,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next approach!</font>

194
00:15:00,710 --> 00:15:03,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look! I'm really out of time.</font>

195
00:15:05,880 --> 00:15:08,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a secret, but there's
an awesome path</font>

196
00:15:08,550 --> 00:15:11,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that can get you inside the arena
in an instant, here!</font>

197
00:15:12,090 --> 00:15:16,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! All right!
Well done, Konohamaru!</font>

198
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:20,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This hole is a shortcut?</font>

199
00:15:21,150 --> 00:15:23,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a straight shot to
the final round arena!</font>

200
00:15:23,650 --> 00:15:25,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No doubt, here!</font>

201
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:29,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Straight shot, huh?
Okay!</font>

202
00:15:29,700 --> 00:15:31,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's hurry!</font>

203
00:15:31,410 --> 00:15:32,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

204
00:15:37,620 --> 00:15:39,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru!
What's happening here?!</font>

205
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:41,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay, here!</font>

206
00:15:41,460 --> 00:15:43,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're almost to the final
round arena, here!</font>

207
00:15:44,460 --> 00:15:46,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See? There's the exit, here!</font>

208
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:49,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, oh.</font>

209
00:15:50,800 --> 00:15:51,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

210
00:15:59,770 --> 00:16:02,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!</font>

211
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:06,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This is... some kind of mistake!</font>

212
00:16:07,900 --> 00:16:11,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kooonooohaaamaaaruuu!</font>

213
00:16:11,900 --> 00:16:14,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell are you doing?!</font>

214
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:18,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've gotten further
and further away!</font>

215
00:16:18,370 --> 00:16:20,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Until just recently,</font>

216
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:22,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it was connected to the
final round arena, here.</font>

217
00:16:22,830 --> 00:16:25,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next approach, right away...</font>

218
00:16:30,010 --> 00:16:31,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is it!</font>

219
00:16:35,680 --> 00:16:39,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you ride this, you'll get to the
final round arena just like that, here!</font>

220
00:16:41,640 --> 00:16:43,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? A bull?</font>

221
00:16:44,060 --> 00:16:45,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Think again, nii-chan.</font>

222
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:50,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A feudal lord Bull is not at all in
the same league as ordinary cows, here.</font>

223
00:16:50,900 --> 00:16:53,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once they start running,
even race horses grow deathly pale.</font>

224
00:16:53,820 --> 00:16:56,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way they can beat
a no-nonsense feudal lord cow!</font>

225
00:16:56,740 --> 00:16:58,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, it's an awesome cow!</font>

226
00:17:03,910 --> 00:17:07,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-chan, if you leave the rest to this cow,</font>

227
00:17:07,380 --> 00:17:09,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's just a short run to
the final round arena, here!</font>

228
00:17:10,420 --> 00:17:12,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, I'm counting on you.</font>

229
00:17:12,130 --> 00:17:13,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, let's go!</font>

230
00:17:19,140 --> 00:17:20,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Wha...?!</font>

231
00:17:25,560 --> 00:17:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch!</font>

232
00:17:36,530 --> 00:17:37,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

233
00:17:51,460 --> 00:17:53,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-chan, go for it, here!</font>

234
00:17:53,590 --> 00:17:56,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Stop! Stop!</font>

235
00:18:12,610 --> 00:18:16,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey hey, we're missing quite
a few people.</font>

236
00:18:17,070 --> 00:18:21,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?
It's going to start.</font>

237
00:18:22,080 --> 00:18:24,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the meaning of this?
Sasuke-kun...?</font>

238
00:18:25,040 --> 00:18:26,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And even Naruto...</font>

239
00:18:33,800 --> 00:18:36,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is it?!</font>

240
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:46,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad!</font>

241
00:18:47,560 --> 00:18:48,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it!</font>

242
00:18:48,640 --> 00:18:50,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

243
00:18:53,020 --> 00:18:55,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guys! Scatter the rampaging cows!</font>

244
00:18:55,780 --> 00:18:56,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yeah!
— Yeah!</font>

245
00:19:09,670 --> 00:19:13,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong with you guys?
Why are you back, hey?!</font>

246
00:19:14,710 --> 00:19:15,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More appeared!</font>

247
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:18,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The escape path was blocked!</font>

248
00:19:18,380 --> 00:19:21,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It won't do any good to multiply!</font>

249
00:19:25,810 --> 00:19:27,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm? What the...?!</font>

250
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:29,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uzumaki Naruto...?</font>

251
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:31,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We leave the rest to you!</font>

252
00:19:33,110 --> 00:19:35,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whoa, let us in, quick!</font>

253
00:19:35,690 --> 00:19:36,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

254
00:19:36,440 --> 00:19:37,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Entry has already...!</font>

255
00:19:50,460 --> 00:19:53,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What kind... of entrance is
this kid making...?</font>

256
00:19:57,420 --> 00:19:58,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

257
00:19:58,800 --> 00:20:01,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's totally late.</font>

258
00:20:02,930 --> 00:20:04,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a drag.</font>

259
00:20:07,060 --> 00:20:12,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guys, run! A large herd of
stampeding bulls is coming.</font>

260
00:20:12,600 --> 00:20:15,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What are you talking about?</font>

261
00:20:15,110 --> 00:20:18,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez! I'm serious.
So many of them...!</font>

262
00:20:23,410 --> 00:20:26,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Hey...
Where's Sasuke?</font>

263
00:20:26,410 --> 00:20:29,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Dosu guy I'm supposed
to fight isn't here, either.</font>

264
00:20:29,120 --> 00:20:31,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you guys there.</font>

265
00:20:31,080 --> 00:20:32,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be restless.</font>

266
00:20:33,080 --> 00:20:36,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Throw out your chests and
show your faces to the spectators!</font>

267
00:20:57,520 --> 00:21:01,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are the stars of
this "final round".</font>

